      <title>思特威公告拟向武汉楚兴增资 15 亿元，锁定高端 CMOS 图像传感器国产代工产能</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261122-202703&amp;cat=tech&amp;event=evt_03d48473f116</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261122-202703:evt_03d48473f116</guid>
